{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27203","headline":"春雪 一 · 焦郁","name":"春雪 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"散漫天涯色，乘春四望平。\n不分残照影，何处断鸿声。\n缭绕先经塞，霏微近过城。\n因风低未歛，带雨重还轻。\n干吕知时泰，如膏候岁成。\n小儒同品物，无以荅皇明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"焦郁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}